# Normalise to LF in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ─── SIGNED CONTRACTS — byte-exact, DO NOT let git rewrite line endings ────
# The ECDSA-P256 signatures in extension/contracts/signatures/ are computed over
# the raw bytes of these files. A CRLF conversion silently invalidates every
# signature (this has already happened once in this repo's history: the files
# were signed on macOS with LF, arrived on Windows as CRLF, and contract
# verification failed until they were normalised back). Marking them binary
# stops git from ever touching them.
extension/contracts/*.json           -text
extension/contracts/signatures/*.json -text
extension/contracts/keys/*.pem       -text

# Keep model/data artefacts byte-stable too (hashes are recorded in registry_meta).
backend/data/sebi_register.json      -text
ml/feature_manifest.json             -text

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pkl binary
*.rar binary
